{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>The right [ear].</b> Like הפנימית. The sense of \"on the lobe\" — in this section it is, and behold, the blood atones for the soul of Aaron. Likewise, \"for the blood, it is in the soul, atones\" — its sense is: in the soul, that there is in it to atone. And behold, a soul in place of a soul. And closer than this sense is \"and she touches his feet.\""], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:04.149005153Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}